=== MainPtr Structure Differences ===
The HitPtr structure mainly categorizes into AoE attack hits and projectile attack hits, but fundamentally they are the same.
* Projectile attacks, such as {{Weapon|Lato}}'s hitscan shot, {{Weapon|Synapse}}'s hitscan shot, {{Weapon|Quassus}} Heavy Attack projectiles, etc.
* AoE attacks, such as {{Weapon|Tenet Envoy}}'s AoE (excluding projectiles), {{Weapon|Kronen}}'s melee attack, {{Weapon|Tenet Exec}}'s Slam Attack, etc.
<hr />
* Projectile attacks further divide into hitscan attacks and "true" projectile attacks.
* AoE attacks further divide into melee attacks and AoE attacks.
** Melee weapons' melee attacks are treated as AoE attacks similarly; however, if dual-wielded, each side has their own HitPtr structure. In other words, the left-handed melee will have its own HitPtr separate from the right-handed melee on a single "Attack" input.

