There are multiple types of HitPtr that can originate from the player, each is independently tracked by the game for purposes of calculating damage and rolling for effects.
* Note that Main HitPtr is the parent for all Other HitPtr types; without a Main HitPtr, other effects cannot add their HitPtrs.

